S):row:4:cell:Free"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:189", "head": "Just Breathe", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Just_Breathe", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "row_index": 4, "column_name": "Song title", "header_path": ["Song title"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Just_Breathe", "text": "Just Breathe is LoveHateHero 's first album , released on May 17 , 2005 . The song Theatre of Robots features the vocals of Juliet Simms of Automatic Loveletter .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Just_Breathe", "traversal_to": "Just Breathe", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:36", "head": "Just Breathe", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "row_index": 4, "column_name": "Song title", "header_path": ["Song title"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Just Breathe", "traversal_to": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:42", "head": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4", "relation": "free", "tail": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4:cell:Free", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "row_index": 4, "column_name": "Free", "header_path": ["Free"], "structural": true, "cell_node": true, "cell_value": "No", "traversal_from": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4", "traversal_to": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4:cell:Free", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Just Breathe --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Just_Breathe [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "Just Breathe --has_record--> table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4 --free--> table:Rock Band (iOS):row:4:cell:Free", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.3, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 15.0714}}, {"path_id": "answer_evidence_record_198", "score": 183.0, "score_components": {"reverse_answer_match": 183.0}, "nodes": ["No Doubt", "passage:/wiki/No_Doubt"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:198", "head": "No Doubt", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/No_Doubt", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "row_index": 10, "column_name": "Artist", "header_path": ["Artist"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/No_Doubt", "text": "No Doubt Is an American rock band from Anaheim , California , formed in 1986 . The band consists of vocalist Gwen Stefani , guitarist Tom Dumont , bassist Tony Kanal , and drummer Adrian Young . Since the mid-1990s , they have been supported by trombonist Gabrial McNair and trumpeter Stephen Bradley in live performances . Though their 1992 eponymous debut album failed to make an impact , its ska punk inspired follow-up The Beacon Street Collection sold over 100,000 copies in 1995 , over three times as many as its predecessor . The band 's diamond-certified album Tragic Kingdom ( 1995 ) benefited from the resurgence of third-wave ska in the 1990s , and Do n't Speak , the third single from the album , set a record when it spent 16 weeks at the number one spot on the Billboard Hot 100 Airplay chart . Just a Girl , co-written by Stefani , was described as the most popular cut on the CD . The group 's next album , Return of Saturn ( 2000 ) , despite its Top 40 hit single Simple Kind of Life , did not match the success of their previous album , but received critical praise and was nominated for Best Rock Album at the 43rd Grammy Awards . Fifteen months later , the band reappeared with the album Rock Steady ( 2001 ) , which incorporated reggae and dancehall music into their work . The album was primarily recorded in Jamaica and featured collaborations with Jamaican artists Bounty Killer , Sly and Robbie , and Lady Saw . The album produced two Grammy-winning singles , Hey Baby and Underneath It All . Hella Good was also nominated for a Grammy award . On November 22 , 2002 , No Doubt received the Key to the City of Anaheim , given by the Mayor of Anaheim , Tom Daly , in Disneyland during the band 's appearance on 'Breakfast with Kevin and Bean ' ( KROQ-FM ) where they performed five songs .", "context_before": ""}]}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "No Doubt --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/No_Doubt", "depends_on": null}], "path_verification": {"status": "answer_evidence", "selection_score": 183.0, "hard_failures": []}, "created_after_answer": true}, {"path_id": "answer_evidence_record_200", "score": 183.0, "score_components": {"reverse_answer_match": 183.0}, "nodes": ["No Doubt", "passage:/wiki/No_Doubt"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:200", "head": "No Doubt", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/No_Doubt", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "row_index": 11, "column_name": "Artist", "header_path": ["Artist"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/No_Doubt", "text": "No Doubt Is an American rock band from Anaheim , California , formed in 1986 . The band consists of vocalist Gwen Stefani , guitarist Tom Dumont , bassist Tony Kanal , and drummer Adrian Young . Since the mid-1990s , they have been supported by trombonist Gabrial McNair and trumpeter Stephen Bradley in live performances . Though their 1992 eponymous debut album failed to make an impact , its ska punk inspired follow-up The Beacon Street Collection sold over 100,000 copies in 1995 , over three times as many as its predecessor . The band 's diamond-certified album Tragic Kingdom ( 1995 ) benefited from the resurgence of third-wave ska in the 1990s , and Do n't Speak , the third single from the album , set a record when it spent 16 weeks at the number one spot on the Billboard Hot 100 Airplay chart . Just a Girl , co-written by Stefani , was described as the most popular cut on the CD . The group 's next album , Return of Saturn ( 2000 ) , despite its Top 40 hit single Simple Kind of Life , did not match the success of their previous album , but received critical praise and was nominated for Best Rock Album at the 43rd Grammy Awards . Fifteen months later , the band reappeared with the album Rock Steady ( 2001 ) , which incorporated reggae and dancehall music into their work . The album was primarily recorded in Jamaica and featured collaborations with Jamaican artists Bounty Killer , Sly and Robbie , and Lady Saw . The album produced two Grammy-winning singles , Hey Baby and Underneath It All . Hella Good was also nominated for a Grammy award . On November 22 , 2002 , No Doubt received the Key to the City of Anaheim , given by the Mayor of Anaheim , Tom Daly , in Disneyland during the band 's appearance on 'Breakfast with Kevin and Bean ' ( KROQ-FM ) where they performed five songs .", "context_before": ""}]}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "No Doubt --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/No_Doubt", "depends_on": null}], "path_verification": {"status": "answer_evidence", "selection_score": 183.0, "hard_failures": []}, "created_after_answer": true}, {"path_id": "answer_evidence_semantic_39_0", "score": 183.0, "score_components": {"reverse_answer_match": 183.0}, "nodes": ["No Doubt", "/wiki/No_Doubt"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "semantic:39:0", "head": "No Doubt", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "/wiki/No_Doubt", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Rock Band (iOS)", "source_group": null, "row_index": 10, "column_name": "Artist", "header_path": ["Artist"], "structural": false, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/No_Doubt", "text": "No Doubt Is an American rock band from Anaheim , California , formed in 1986 . The band consists of vocalist Gwen Stefani , guitarist Tom Dumont , bassist Tony Kanal , and drummer Adrian Young . Since the mid-1990s , they have been supported by trombonist Gabrial McNair and trumpeter Stephen Bradley in live performances . Though their 1992 eponymous debut album failed to make an impact , its ska punk inspired follow-up The Beacon Street Collection sold over 100,000 copies in 1995 , over three times as many as its predecessor . The band 's diamond-certified album Tragic Kingdom ( 1995 ) benefited from the resurgence of third-wave ska in the 1990s , and Do n't Speak , the third single from the album , set a record when it spent 16 weeks at the number one spot on the Billboard Hot 100 Airplay chart . Just a Girl , co-written by Stefani , was described as the most popular cut on the CD . The group 's next album , Return of Saturn ( 2000 ) , despite its Top 40 hit single Simple Kind of Life , did not match the success of their previous album , but received critical praise and was nominated for Best Rock Album at the 43rd Grammy Awards . Fifteen months later , the band reappeared with the album Rock Steady ( 2001 ) , which incorporated reggae and dancehall music into their work . The album was primarily recorded in Jamaica and featured collaborations with Jamaican artists Bounty Killer , Sly and Robbie , and Lady Saw . The album produced two Grammy-winning singles , Hey Baby and Underneath It All . Hella Good was also nominated for a Grammy award . On November 22 , 2002 , No Doubt received the Key to the City of Anaheim , given by the Mayor of Anaheim , Tom Daly , in Disneyland during the band 's appearance on 'Breakfast with Kevin and Bean ' ( KROQ-FM ) where they performed five songs .", "context_before": ""}]}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "No Doubt --linked_passage--> /wiki/No_Doubt", "depends_on": null}], "path_verification": {"status": "answer_evidence", "selection_score": 183.0, "hard_failures": []}, "created_after_answer": true}], "best_path_id": "grounded_229", "best_path_score": 10.3714, "execution_mode": "path_text", "code_generated": false, "program_executed": false, "text_extraction_mode": "direct_context_no_llm", "path_context_policy": "planner_top_n_paths_only", "top_n_paths": 5, "llm_