SuperDraft:row:9", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "2003 MLS SuperDraft", "row_index": 9, "column_name": "Pick #", "header_path": ["Pick #"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "60", "traversal_to": "table:2003 MLS SuperDraft:row:9", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:129", "head": "table:2003 MLS SuperDraft:row:9", "relation": "mls_team", "tail": "Kansas City Wizards", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "2003 MLS SuperDraft", "row_index": 9, "column_name": "MLS team", "header_path": ["MLS team"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:2003 MLS SuperDraft:row:9", "traversal_to": "Kansas City Wizards", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:163", "head": "Kansas City Wizards", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "2003 MLS SuperDraft", "row_index": 9, "column_name": "MLS team", "header_path": ["MLS team"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "text": "Sporting Kansas City , often shortened to Sporting KC , is an American professional soccer club based in Kansas City , Kansas . The administrative offices are located in Downtown Kansas City , Missouri , and the team clubhouse and practice facilities are located in Kansas City , Kansas near Children 's Mercy Park . The club competes as a member of the Western Conference in Major League Soccer ( MLS ) , having returned in 2015 after spending ten seasons in the Eastern Conference . Sporting KC began play in 1996 as a charter team in the league , then known as the Kansas City Wiz . The team was founded by Lamar Hunt in 1995 . Since moving across the state line , they have been the only major professional sports league franchise to play their home games in Kansas . For the majority of their existence , the franchise were known as the Kansas City Wizards . The team rebranded in November 2010 , coinciding with its move to their home stadium , now known as Children 's Mercy Park . The franchise has won the MLS Cup twice ( 2000 , 2013 ) , the Supporters ' Shield in 2000 , and the U.S. Open Cup in 2004 , 2012 , 2015 and 2017 . The club also has a reserve team , Sporting Kansas City II , that plays in the second-tier USL Championship .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Kansas City Wizards", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "60 --has_record--> table:2003 MLS SuperDraft:row:9", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:2003 MLS SuperDraft:row:9 --mls_team--> Kansas City Wizards", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Kansas City Wizards --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": null, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 16.8}}, {"path_id": "grounded_55", "score": 11.15, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 0.0, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 1.0, "query_coverage": 1.3333, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 0.0, "row_entity_binding": 0.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 4.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 0.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.35}, "nodes": ["60", "Kansas City Wizards", "/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "semantic:55:0", "head": "60", "relation": "mls_team", "tail": "Kansas City Wizards", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "2003 MLS SuperDraft", "source_group": null, "row_index": 9, "column_name": "MLS team", "header_path": ["MLS team"], "structural": false, "contexts": [], "traversal_from": "60", "traversal_to": "Kansas City Wizards", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "semantic:20:0", "head": "Kansas City Wizards", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "2003 MLS SuperDraft", "source_group": null, "row_index": 2, "column_name": "MLS team", "header_path": ["MLS team"], "structural": false, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "text": "Sporting Kansas City , often shortened to Sporting KC , is an American professional soccer club based in Kansas City , Kansas . The administrative offices are located in Downtown Kansas City , Missouri , and the team clubhouse and practice facilities are located in Kansas City , Kansas near Children 's Mercy Park . The club competes as a member of the Western Conference in Major League Soccer ( MLS ) , having returned in 2015 after spending ten seasons in the Eastern Conference . Sporting KC began play in 1996 as a charter team in the league , then known as the Kansas City Wiz . The team was founded by Lamar Hunt in 1995 . Since moving across the state line , they have been the only major professional sports league franchise to play their home games in Kansas . For the majority of their existence , the franchise were known as the Kansas City Wizards . The team rebranded in November 2010 , coinciding with its move to their home stadium , now known as Children 's Mercy Park . The franchise has won the MLS Cup twice ( 2000 , 2013 ) , the Supporters ' Shield in 2000 , and the U.S. Open Cup in 2004 , 2012 , 2015 and 2017 . The club also has a reserve team , Sporting Kansas City II , that plays in the second-tier USL Championship .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Kansas City Wizards", "traversal_to": "/wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "60 --mls_team--> Kansas City Wizards", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "Kansas City Wizards --linked_passage--> /wiki/Kansas_City_Wizards", "depends_on": 1}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_