omedian Emil Steinberger . He has had roles in 102 films and television shows . He had been married with Eva-Maria Bendig since 1957 ; they have two children , Daniel ( 1957-1987 ) and Oliver ( b . 1958 ) . He died on 17 June 2012 , at the age of 85 in a hospital in Locarno , Ticino , due to pneumonia after suffering a hip fracture in his residence in Losone . His funeral took place on Tuesday , 26 June , in Untersiggenthal in the canton of Aargau .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Jürgen Prochnow , Ernst Hannawald , Walo Lüönd , Edith Volkmann , Erwin Kohlund , Hans Irle , Erwin Parker , Alexander Ziegler , Werner Schwuchow , Hans-Michael Rehberg , Elisabeth Fricker , Hans Putz , Wolf Gaudlitz , Thomas Haerin , Carsten Neumann , Franz Kollasch , Alexis von Hagemeister , Jan Groth , Gerold Nölli and Franz Stiefel", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Walo_Lüönd", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Die Konsequenz --has_record--> table:List of LGBT-related films of 1977:row:5", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:List of LGBT-related films of 1977:row:5 --cast--> Jürgen Prochnow , Ernst Hannawald , Walo Lüönd , Edith Volkmann , Erwin Kohlund , Hans Irle , Erwin Parker , Alexander Ziegler , Werner Schwuchow , Hans-Michael Rehberg , Elisabeth Fricker , Hans Putz , Wolf Gaudlitz , Thomas Haerin , Carsten Neumann , Franz Kollasch , Alexis von Hagemeister , Jan Groth , Gerold Nölli and Franz Stiefel", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Jürgen Prochnow , Ernst Hannawald , Walo Lüönd , Edith Volkmann , Erwin Kohlund , Hans Irle , Erwin Parker , Alexander Ziegler , Werner Schwuchow , Hans-Michael Rehberg , Elisabeth Fricker , Hans Putz , Wolf Gaudlitz , Thomas Haerin , Carsten Neumann , Franz Kollasch , Alexis von Hagemeister , Jan Groth , Gerold Nölli and Franz Stiefel --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Walo_Lüönd", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.4, "