. divisjon at end of 2009 season in 16th and last position despite a good start . In 2018 , Skeid won 2. divisjon group 1 and was promoted to the 1. divisjon . They played in the Norwegian top flight between 1938-1970 ( Norwegian League did n't play between 1940-1947 due to World War II ) , 1972-1975 ( 4 seasons ) , 1978-1980 ( 3 seasons ) , 1996-1997 ( 2 seasons ) . Their recent season in the top division was in the 1999 Tippeligaen .", "context_before": "SK Brann ( most often simply called Brann ) is a Norwegian professional football club , founded 26 September 1908 , from Bergen . Brann has been in the Eliteserien , Norway 's Premier Division of Football , since 1987 , bar one season spent in the 1. divisjon in 2015 . They play their home matches at Brann Stadion where they had a record-breaking 17,310 in average attendance in the 2007 season . In October 2007 , Brann won the Norwegian league title for the first time since 1963 . The 1952-1953 Hovedserien was the 8th completed season of top division football in Norway ."}], "traversal_from": "Skeid Fotball", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Skeid_Fotball", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "1952-53 --has_record--> table:List of Norwegian football champions:row:4", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:List of Norwegian football champions:row:4 --runners_up--> Skeid Fotball", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Skeid Fotball --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Skeid_Fotball", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.6, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": null, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 20.55}}, {"path_id": "answer_evidence_record_182", "score": 101.5, "score_components": {"reverse_answer_match": 101.5}, "nodes": ["table:List of Norwegian football champions:row:8:cell:Leading goalscorer", "Per Kristoffersen ( Fredrikstad )"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "reco