Sanzo", "text": "Salvatore Sanzo ( born 26 November 1975 ) is an Italian fencer and Olympian . He won a team gold and individual silver medal in Athens and an individual bronze medal in Beijing in foil .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Salvatore_Sanzo", "traversal_to": "Salvatore Sanzo", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:317", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "name", "tail": "Salvatore Sanzo", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Salvatore Sanzo", "traversal_to": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:312", "head": "Bronze", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Medal", "header_path": ["Medal"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "traversal_to": "Bronze", "direction": "reverse"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Salvatore Sanzo --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Salvatore_Sanzo [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --name--> Salvatore Sanzo [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Bronze --has_record--> table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.4444, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": false, "selection_score": 19.0667}}, {"path_id": "grounded_126", "score": 12.8834, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 1.0, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 0.75, "query_coverage": 1.6667, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 0.0, "row_entity_binding": 0.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 5.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["Salvatore Sanzo", "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "Fencing", "passage:/wiki/Fencing"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:317", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "name", "tail": "Salvatore Sanzo", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Salvatore Sanzo", "traversal_to": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:320", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "sport", "tail": "Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "traversal_to": "Fencing", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:329", "head": "Fencing", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Fencing", "text": "Fencing is a group of three related combat sports . The three disciplines in modern fencing are the foil , the épée , and the sabre ( also saber ) ; winning points are made through the weapon 's contact with an opponent . A fourth discipline , singlestick , appeared in the 1904 Olympics but was dropped after that , and is not a part of modern fencing . Fencing was one of the first sports to be played in the Olympics . Based on the traditional skills of swordsmanship , the modern sport arose at the end of the 19th century , with the Italian school having modified the historical European martial art of classical fencing , and the French school later refining the Italian system . There are three forms of modern fencing , each of which uses a different kind of weapon and has different rules ; thus the sport itself is divided into three competitive scenes : foil , épée , and sabre . Most competitive fencers choose to specialize in one weapon only . Competitive fencing is one of the five activities which have been featured in every modern Olympic Games , the other four being athletics , cycling , swimming , and gymnastics .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Fencing", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --name--> Salvatore Sanzo [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --sport--> Fencing", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Fencing --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Fencing", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8889, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 18.3834}}, {"path_id": "grounded_127", "score": 12.8834, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 1.0, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 0.75, "query_coverage": 1.6667, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 0.0, "row_entity_binding": 0.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 5.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["Salvatore Sanzo", "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "Fencing", "passage:/wiki/Fencing"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:317", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "name", "tail": "Salvatore Sanzo", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Salvatore Sanzo", "traversal_to": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:320", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "sport", "tail": "Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "traversal_to": "Fencing", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:337", "head": "Fencing", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 2, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Fencing", "text": "Fencing is a group of three related combat sports . The three disciplines in modern fencing are the foil , the épée , and the sabre ( also saber ) ; winning points are made through the weapon 's contact with an opponent . A fourth discipline , singlestick , appeared in the 1904 Olympics but was dropped after that , and is not a part of modern fencing . Fencing was one of the first sports to be played in the Olympics . Based on the traditional skills of swordsmanship , the modern sport arose at the end of the 19th century , with the Italian school having modified the historical European martial art of classical fencing , and the French school later refining the Italian system . There are three forms of modern fencing , each of which uses a different kind of weapon and has different rules ; thus the sport itself is divided into three competitive scenes : foil , épée , and sabre . Most competitive fencers choose to specialize in one weapon only . Competitive fencing is one of the five activities which have been featured in every modern Olympic Games , the other four being athletics , cycling , swimming , and gymnastics .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Fencing", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --name--> Salvatore Sanzo [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --sport--> Fencing", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Fencing --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Fencing", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8889, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 18.3834}}, {"path_id": "grounded_128", "score": 12.8834, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 1.0, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 0.75, "query_coverage": 1.6667, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 0.0, "row_entity_binding": 0.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 5.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["Salvatore Sanzo", "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "Fencing", "passage:/wiki/Fencing"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:317", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "name", "tail": "Salvatore Sanzo", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Salvatore Sanzo", "traversal_to": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:320", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "sport", "tail": "Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "traversal_to": "Fencing", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:414", "head": "Fencing", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 18, "column_name": "Sport", "header_path": ["Sport"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Fencing", "text": "Fencing is a group of three related combat sports . The three disciplines in modern fencing are the foil , the épée , and the sabre ( also saber ) ; winning points are made through the weapon 's contact with an opponent . A fourth discipline , singlestick , appeared in the 1904 Olympics but was dropped after that , and is not a part of modern fencing . Fencing was one of the first sports to be played in the Olympics . Based on the traditional skills of swordsmanship , the modern sport arose at the end of the 19th century , with the Italian school having modified the historical European martial art of classical fencing , and the French school later refining the Italian system . There are three forms of modern fencing , each of which uses a different kind of weapon and has different rules ; thus the sport itself is divided into three competitive scenes : foil , épée , and sabre . Most competitive fencers choose to specialize in one weapon only . Competitive fencing is one of the five activities which have been featured in every modern Olympic Games , the other four being athletics , cycling , swimming , and gymnastics .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "Fencing", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Fencing", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --name--> Salvatore Sanzo [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19 --sport--> Fencing", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Fencing --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Fencing", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8889, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 18.3834}}, {"path_id": "row_19_104", "score": 12.9667, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 1.0, "relation_match": 0.0, "text_context_match": 0.5, "query_coverage": 0.6667, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 1.0, "row_entity_binding": 1.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 5.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["Bronze", "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "Salvatore Sanzo", "passage:/wiki/Salvatore_Sanzo"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:312", "head": "Bronze", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Medal", "header_path": ["Medal"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Bronze", "traversal_to": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:317", "head": "table:Italy at the 2008 Summer Olympics:row:19", "relation": "name