during the Civil War . It was added to the National Register of Historic Places in 1977 . Since 2016 , the Church of the Assumption has celebrated the Traditional Latin Mass every Sunday , and some other days of the week , in addition to the English post-Vatican II Mass . The Revd S Bede Price was appointed 35th Pastor of the Church of the Assumption in June of 2019 and installed by The Most Revd J Mark Spalding on the Feast of the Assumption .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Church_of_the_Assumption_(Nashville,_Tennessee)", "traversal_to": "Church of the Assumption", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:110", "head": "Church of the Assumption", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "List of Catholic churches in the United States", "row_index": 6, "column_name": "Church", "header_path": ["Church"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Church of the Assumption", "traversal_to": "table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:127", "head": "table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6", "relation": "description", "tail": "Gothic Revival", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "List of Catholic churches in the United States", "row_index": 6, "column_name": "Description", "header_path": ["Description"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6", "traversal_to": "Gothic Revival", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Church of the Assumption --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Church_of_the_Assumption_(Nashville,_Tennessee) [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "Church of the Assumption --has_record--> table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "table:List of Catholic churches in the United States:row:6 --description-->