. It is known for its focaccia al formaggio ( focaccia with cheese ) which is made with stracchino . The consortium that dictates the official recipe of the focaccia , supposedly the result of a Saracen attack in the 13th century , has obtained the European Union PGI status for the recipe . Recco is home to the September 8 fireworks festival honoring the Virgin Mary . The town is also known for its successful waterpolo team , Pro Recco . During World War II Recco 's railway was bombed by the Allies , destroying the town . It was rebuilt in the late forties and early 1950s .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Recco", "traversal_to": "Recco", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:0", "head": "Recco", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "City", "header_path": ["City"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Recco", "traversal_to": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:12", "head": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "relation": "winning_clubs", "tail": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Winning clubs", "header_path": ["Winning clubs"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "traversal_to": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Recco --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Recco [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "Recco --has_record--> table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records a