home to the September 8 fireworks festival honoring the Virgin Mary . The town is also known for its successful waterpolo team , Pro Recco . During World War II Recco 's railway was bombed by the Allies , destroying the town . It was rebuilt in the late forties and early 1950s .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Recco", "traversal_to": "Recco", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:0", "head": "Recco", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "City", "header_path": ["City"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Recco", "traversal_to": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:6", "head": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "relation": "runners_up", "tail": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Runners-up", "header_path": ["Runners-up"], "structural": true, "cell_node": true, "cell_value": "Pro Recco ( 7 )", "traversal_from": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "traversal_to": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Recco --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Recco [traverse reverse]", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "Recco --has_record--> table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0 --runners_up--> table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.5385, "table_witness_indices": [0], "linked_witness": true, "numeric_evidence": null, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 23.05}}, {"path_id": "grounded_279", "score": 17.05, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 1.0, "relation_match": 1.3333, "text_context_match": 0.25, "query_coverage": 0.6667, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 2.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 0.0, "row_entity_binding": 0.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 0.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 8.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["passage:/wiki/Pro_Recco", "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:289", "head": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Pro_Recco", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Winning clubs", "header_path": ["Winning clubs"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Pro_Recco", "text": "A.S.D . Pro Recco ( Official name : Associazione Sportiva Dilettantistica Pro Recco ) is an Italian water polo club from Recco , in Liguria . It currently plays in Serie A1 .", "context_before": "Recco ( Latin : Ricina / Recina ) is a comune in the Metropolitan City of Genoa , region of Liguria , Italy . It is known for its focaccia al formaggio ( focaccia with cheese ) which is made with stracchino . The consortium that dictates the official recipe of the focaccia , supposedly the result of a Saracen attack in the 13th century , has obtained the European Union PGI status for the recipe . Recco is home to the September 8 fireworks festival honoring the Virgin Mary . The town is also known for its successful waterpolo team , Pro Recco . During World War II Recco 's railway was bombed by the Allies , destroying the town . It was rebuilt in the late forties and early 1950s ."}], "traversal_from": "passage:/wiki/Pro_Recco", "traversal_to": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:12", "head": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "relation": "winning_clubs", "tail": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Winning clubs", "header_path": ["Winning clubs"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "Pro Recco ( 8 )", "traversal_to": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:6", "head": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "relation": "runners_up", "tail": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics", "row_index": 0, "column_name": "Runners-up", "header_path": ["Runners-up"], "structural": true, "cell_node": true, "cell_value": "Pro Recco ( 7 )", "traversal_from": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0", "traversal_to": "table:European Cup, Euroleague and LEN Champions League records and statistics:row:0:cell:Runners-up", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "Pro Recco ( 8 )