 Majesty , designed in 1954 , is above the chancel arch . The exterior is rendered", "traversal_to": "table:List of places of worship in Worthing:row:1", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:24", "head": "St Mary 's Church", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:List of places of worship in Worthing:row:1", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "List of places of worship in Worthing", "row_index": 1, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:List of places of worship in Worthing:row:1", "traversal_to": "St Mary 's Church", "direction": "reverse"}, {"edge_id": "record:451", "head": "St Mary 's Church", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/St_Mary's_Church,_Goring-by-Sea", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "List of places of worship in Worthing", "row_index": 1, "column_name": "Name", "header_path": ["Name"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/St_Mary's_Church,_Goring-by-Sea", "text": "St Mary 's Church is an Anglican church in the Goring-by-Sea area of the Borough of Worthing , one of seven local government districts in the English county of West Sussex . The late Norman parish church of the ancient village of Goring retains some architectural elements from that period , but Decimus Burton 's comprehensive restoration of 1837 has given the church its present Gothic Revival exterior appearance . German artist Hans Feibusch , who worked extensively in the Diocese of Chichester , provided a mural in 1954 : it is considered impressive , but caused controversy at the time . English Heritage has listed the church at Grade II* for its architectural and historical importance .", "context_before": ""}], "traversal_from": "St Mary 's Church", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/St_Mary's_Church,_Goring-by-Sea", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "table:List of places of worship in Worthing:row:1 --notes--> Decimus Burton rebuilt this late Norman church in the Goth