"Laughing Villa Season 2", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Urvashi (actress)", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Program", "header_path": ["Program"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:19", "traversal_to": "Laughing Villa Season 2", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:331", "head": "Laughing Villa Season 2", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Laughing_Villa", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Urvashi (actress)", "row_index": 19, "column_name": "Program", "header_path": ["Program"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Laughing_Villa", "text": "Laughing Villa ( Ml ; ലാഫിംഗ്‌ വില്ല ) is an Indian Malayalam celebrity comedy chat show which premiered on Surya TV . The first season of the show was hosted by south-Indian film actors Navya Nair & Maniyanpilla Raju . The show also casts Surabhi Lakshmi , Manju Pillai , Naseer Sankranthi & Noby Marcose as character artists . Surya TV has launched the second season of show from 2 April 2017 in a new format as a reality show . Jyothi Krishna ( actress ) hosts the show . Surya TV has launched the third season of show from 18 May 2018 as movie promotion - talk show . Gayathri Arun hosts the show", "context_before": "Comedy Utsavam , is a Malayalam comedy show which premiered on 20 November 2016 and is broadcast by Flowers ( TV channel ) . The show is directed by Mithilaj Abdul and hosted by Mithun Ramesh and airs on Monday to Tuesday at 10.00 pm . It is a talent show that features dancers , singers , celebrity impersonators , comedians , and other performers . The performances are analyzed by chief reviewer Tini Tom along with his co-panel including Guinness Pakru Kalabhavan Prajoth and Bijukuttan . The show provides a platform to showcase the talents of talented peoples across India . Currently new season of the show Kidilan Comedy Utsavam . A flower , sometimes known as a bloom or blossom , is the reproductive structure found in flowering plants ( plants of the division Magnoliophyta , also called angiosperms ) . The biological function of a flower is to affect reproduction , usually by providing a mechanism for the union of sperm with eggs . Flowers may facilitate outcrossing ( fusion of sperm and eggs from different individuals in a population ) resulting from cross pollination or allow selfing ( fusion of sperm and egg from the same flower ) when self pollination occurs . Some flowers produce diaspores without fertilization ( parthenocarpy ) . Flowers contain sporangia and are the site where gametophytes develop . Many flowers have evolved to be attractive to animals , so as to cause them to be vectors for the transfer of pollen . After fertilization , the ovary of the flower develops into fruit containing seeds . In addition to facilitating the reproduction of flowering plants , flowers have long been admired and used by humans to bring beauty to their environment , and also as objects of romance , ritual , religion , medicine and as a source of food ."}], "traversal_from": "Laughing Villa Season 2", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Laughing_Villa", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "2017 --has_record--> table:Urvashi (actress):row:19", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:19 --program--> Laughing Villa Season 2", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Laughing Villa Season 2 --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Laughing_Villa", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8571, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 14.3167}}, {"path_id": "row_8_35", "score": 8.8167, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 0.0, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 0.75, "query_coverage": 1.6, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 1.0, "row_entity_binding": 1.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 0.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0, "table_witness_match": 0.0, "answer_type_path_filter": 0.0, "same_fact_corroboration": 0.0, "length_penalty": 0.7}, "nodes": ["2011", "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "passage:/wiki/Bhima_Jewels_Comedy_Festival"], "edges": [{"edge_id": "record:116", "head": "2011", "relation": "has_record", "tail": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Urvashi (actress)", "row_index": 8, "column_name": "Year", "header_path": ["Year"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "2011", "traversal_to": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:121", "head": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "relation": "program", "tail": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Urvashi (actress)", "row_index": 8, "column_name": "Program", "header_path": ["Program"], "structural": true, "traversal_from": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "traversal_to": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "direction": "forward"}, {"edge_id": "record:315", "head": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "relation": "linked_passage", "tail": "passage:/wiki/Bhima_Jewels_Comedy_Festival", "source_type": "table", "source_id": "Urvashi (actress)", "row_index": 8, "column_name": "Program", "header_path": ["Program"], "structural": true, "contexts": [{"source_id": "/wiki/Bhima_Jewels_Comedy_Festival", "text": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival , commonly referred to as Comedy Festival is a comedy reality show which is sponsored by Bhima Jewels and was repeatedly aired in Mazhavil Manorama four times a day . It is anchored by Rachana Narayanankutty and Devika hosted the second season . The judges vary because of film shootings which lead to their inconvenience to arrive at the shooting of the programme on time . The chief judges are Siddique , Urvashi , and Ajaykumar .", "context_before": "Surya TV is an Indian pay television channel headquartered in Trivandrum , Kerala that was launched in 1998 . It is the second privately-owned television channel in Malayalam-language , which began to air after Asianet . The channel is part of Sun TV Network , which is headquartered at Chennai , Tamil Nadu . On 16 March 2017 , Surya TV became the third Malayalam-language channel to launch a high-definition simulcast feed broadcasting at 1080i . Rani Maharani is a 1990 Indian Kannada language film directed by B. Ramamurthy , starring Malashri , Ambarish and Shashikumar in lead roles . The supporting cast features Jaggesh , Umashree , Doddanna , Mysore Lokesh , Umesh , Tennis Krishna . The film is a remake of 1989 ChaalBaaz ( 1989 ) . It was remade in 2010 by B. Ramamurthy , titled Na Rani Nee Maharani ."}], "traversal_from": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "traversal_to": "passage:/wiki/Bhima_Jewels_Comedy_Festival", "direction": "forward"}], "steps": [{"step": 1, "goal": "2011 --has_record--> table:Urvashi (actress):row:8", "depends_on": null}, {"step": 2, "goal": "table:Urvashi (actress):row:8 --program--> Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival", "depends_on": 1}, {"step": 3, "goal": "Bhima Jewels Comedy Festival --linked_passage--> passage:/wiki/Bhima_Jewels_Comedy_Festival", "depends_on": 2}], "path_verification": {"status": "qualified", "hard_failures": [], "question_term_coverage": 0.8571, "table_witness_indices": [], "linked_witness": false, "numeric_evidence": true, "terminal_is_container": true, "selection_score": 14.3167}}, {"path_id": "grounded_146", "score": 8.6667, "score_components": {"grounded_edges": 1.0, "query_entity_match": 0.5, "relation_match": 0.6667, "text_context_match": 0.5, "query_coverage": 1.2, "single_venue_specificity": 0.0, "constraint_coverage": 0.0, "cross_modal_completeness": 1.5, "row_context": 1.0, "row_entity_binding": 1.0, "numeric_literal_coverage": 0.0, "strong_keyword_coverage": 0.0, "hyperlink_passage_bridge": 2.0,